      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/i/2bfe46/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2013-04-08T06:16:10.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Well, I finally have a group of 5 friends who enjoy the game enough to actually want to play it. Tonight, we had Chrono Ranger, Haka, Omnitron X, Fanatic, and Unity against Akash Bhuta at Insula Primalis..and we lost. We weren't doing so bad to begin with, but a string of environment targets/villain targets kind of messed us up, and in the end we were unable to defeat her.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>This, however, is good, because I feel like my friends think that we should always win and it should always be easy. My friends reaction to finding out that if Omnitron took 5 damage, he loses all his ongoings that say that. So it was a good learning experience for hopefully many more in the future.&nbsp;</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:37:57.111Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
