      "created_at": "2013-04-08T11:53:15.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I have gotten my butt kicked by more Infernal Relics villains tha anything else.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>*Miss Information looks at me over her reading glasses*</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Okay, yes, fine, you too.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Still, this game is like Pandemic. I have a ton of fun playing, even when the world is doomed because the hero team just got wiped out. (and unlike Pandemic, I can comfort myself with the knowledge that there are other heroes to step up and handle things.)</p>",
